# bad_slant.part -- A cone that leaves a block through a side, on hyperbolas
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

profile r along z 0 0 0 20 0 0 20 10 0 0 10 0
extrude blk from 0 to 5 r
circle c 8 3 5 along z
extrude cs from 5 to 1 c draft 30
subtract u blk cs
